---------------------------------
Hemocell - stent_strut_crossings
---------------------------------
The stent_strut case (in the parent directory) for the strut crossings of three
stents: config_casper.xml, config_protege.xml and config_wallstent.xml, with the
geometries crossing-*.stl. The source differs from ../stent_strut.cpp only in
the height nz used for the shear parameters (0.55 instead of 0.75 refDirN).

The cell files are those of the parent case, and the initial positions are in
cell_pos_files/, one directory per stent. Run from this directory, e.g.:

  cp ../RBC.xml ../PLT.xml .
  cp cell_pos_files/casper/*.pos .
  mpirun -n <ranks> ./stent_strut_crossings config_casper.xml
